author: builder
title: 'M1.3 reading: pin the helper by code-signing requirement, re-check before spawn; identity.json trusted only when the SE confirms it'
summary: 'The helper is pinned by codesign --verify --strict plus a designated requirement (Developer ID Application, team SW4BMQ8PNL, identifier gnomon.helper); inode/size/mtime/sha256 recorded at verification and re-checked synchronously before every spawn. checksums.json is advisory: timestamped signatures change the sha per build. identity.json is same-user writable, so the daemon opens it only when the pinned helper returns the same SE public keys and the approvals binding verifies under that root; anything else refuses to start, never a software root. Each key signs only its own domain prefixes in the helper.'
symbols_touched:
  - '#identity'
  - '#gnomon-helper'
